"test2" COMMENTS
================

******************* Step to run this test *******************************

1. make -f makefile.man all

2. if run all the script, type

	test2.sh 

    and the result will be on "test2.SRr0".  The log will be on "test2a.SLr0"
    and "test2b.SLr0"



3. if run only one script, type

	test2a.sh 
   or
	test2b.sh

    and the result will be on "test2a.SRr0" or "test2b.SRr0" accordingly.  
    The log will be on "test2a.SLr0" or "test2b.SLr0" accordingly.

    "test2a.sh" TAKES ~6 MINUTES TO RUN;
    "test2b.sh" TAKES ~8 MINUTES TO RUN
